    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Distance &amp; Truck Type:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The core cost is driven by the approximate 1,400-kilometer journey from Patna to Navi Mumbai. A 12-foot truck, suitable for a two-bedroom apartment, might cost between ₹18,000 and ₹25,000 for transport alone, while a larger 16-foot vehicle could range from ₹22,000 to ₹30,000.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
