    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Packing Materials &amp; Labor:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Professional packing services add a premium but ensure safety. For a standard household, expect to pay an additional ₹5,000 to ₹8,000 for materials like cartons, bubble wrap, and wooden crates, plus labor charges for skilled packers.</p>
