    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Comprehensive transit insurance is often calculated as a small percentage of the declared value of goods, typically ranging from 1% to 2%. For assets valued at ₹5,00,000, the insurance premium might be around ₹5,000 to ₹10,000.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
  <li style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;">
