      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Essential Documentation &amp; Insurance for Patna To Navi Mumbai Moves</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p><strong>Mandatory paperwork alert:</strong> All shipments must be accompanied by a valid e‑Way bill, a correctly issued GST invoice, the appropriate IBA code, and up‑to‑date insurance documentation. Failure to present any of these items will trigger customs holds, penalties, and possible shipment rejection.</p>
<p>Treat this checklist as non‑negotiable; every transaction is subject to audit, and the primary keyword “mandatory paperwork” must be verified at each hand‑off point.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">e‑Way Bill:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Generate the e‑Way bill before dispatch and attach the QR code to the consignment note. Compliance tip: Verify the bill’s validity in the GST portal within 24 hours of creation; any mismatch in GSTIN or vehicle details will invalidate the mandatory paperwork and delay clearance.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">GST Invoice:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Issue a GST invoice that reflects the exact transaction value, HSN code, and tax rates. Compliance tip: Use sequential invoice numbers and retain a digital copy for 8 years; auditors often cross‑check the invoice against the e‑Way bill to confirm the mandatory paperwork is complete.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA Code:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Include the correct IBA (Import‑Export Business Activity) code on all export declarations and freight documents. Compliance tip: Maintain a master list of active IBA codes for each product line and update it quarterly; an outdated IBA code breaches the mandatory paperwork requirement and can trigger customs fines.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Insurance Certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Secure a cargo insurance policy covering the full declared value and attach the certificate to the shipment manifest. Compliance tip: Confirm the policy’s effective dates match the transit period and keep a scanned copy accessible for customs officers; missing or expired insurance invalidates the mandatory paperwork set and may result in cargo seizure.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>Remember: the integrity of your mandatory paperwork determines whether your goods move swiftly through checkpoints or become stuck in regulatory limbo. Double‑check each item, follow the compliance tips, and keep records organized to avoid costly disruptions.</p></div>
